'''Commander Face''' (武将カオル君, ''Bushō Kaoru-kun'', '''Commander Kaoru-kun''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[The Face]] introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Commander Face
|image = E 703.png
|first appearance = [[Ogo Domain]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
[[The Face]] wearing a [[wikipedia:Kabuto|kabuto]]. Compared to him at 300% magnification, Commander Face has the same health, lower damage, decently increased speed, and more knockbacks.

==Strategy==
Treat it much like the regular Face. [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]] make the fight easier.

